<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>October 30 loading notes</title><style>body{font:14px system-ui;max-width:1100px;margin:24px;color:#183747}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th,td{text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #ccd4d8;padding:8px}th{background:#eef4f5}a{color:#165876}.note{background:#fff2dc;padding:16px}section{margin-top:24px}@media print{a,button{display:none}section{break-before:page}section:first-of-type{break-before:auto}}</style></head><body><a href="/inventory/yard">Back to shared map</a><h1>October 30, 2026 - loading notes</h1><p class="note">These are physical observations from Felipe, not additional receipts. Confirm the product, remaining quantity, lot if required, and exact location against the existing map before adding stock. Pallets with unknown counts must be counted. Acai bricks and unsweetened acai bricks are one product.</p><p>All positions below count from the BACK toward the door. The existing app uses slot 01 nearest the DOOR. These notes were taken with 9 positions per side; confirm locations if a container's layout changes.</p><p>Container 2 has four additional door-area pallets whose contents and exact slots are unconfirmed. Container 6 loading is complete. Containers 1, 3, 4 and 7 have no contents recorded in these notes.</p><button onclick="print()">Print notes</button>
<% [2,5,6].forEach(container=>{ %><section><h2>Container <%= container %></h2><table><thead><tr><th>Side</th><th>From back</th><th>Product</th><th>Remaining</th><th>Notes / review</th></tr></thead><tbody><% loadingNotes.filter(p=>p.container===container).forEach(p=>{ const note=`Oct 30: C${p.container} ${p.side}${p.fromBack} from back; ${p.product}; ${p.quantity===null?'quantity unknown':p.quantity+' '+p.unit}. ${p.note}`; %><tr><td><%= p.side==='L'?'Left':'Right' %></td><td><%= p.fromBack %></td><td><%= p.product %></td><td><%= p.quantity===null?'Count needed':p.quantity+' '+p.unit %></td><td><%= p.note %> <a href="/inventory/add-pallet?c=<%= container %>&product=<%= encodeURIComponent(p.product) %>&note=<%= encodeURIComponent(note) %>">Review / add</a></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table></section><% }); %></body></html>
